exists su name hear backend default ob text "qwen" be default ya
ob filename text recording be input ya

from filename of ob of recording become wo srt to filename "artifacts/hear/qwen-hear-srt-and-text-from-filename.srt" be hear do

ob text "cp \"artifacts/hear/qwen-hear-srt-and-text-from-filename.srt.plain.txt\" \"artifacts/hear/qwen-hear-srt-and-text-from-filename.txt\"" be command do

su name qwen hear outputs be map def
su name srt filename ob filename "artifacts/hear/qwen-hear-srt-and-text-from-filename.srt" ya
su name text filename ob filename "artifacts/hear/qwen-hear-srt-and-text-from-filename.txt" ya
prah

ob name qwen hear outputs be write do
